Electron adaptation notes (44-x-y):
This branch's extensions feature compiler (tools/json_schema_compiler/feature_compiler.py) only accepts hex-encoded SHA1 extension-id hashes in an `allowlist`, so the five SHA-256 entries added upstream are not carried; the SHA1 entries (including the PDF viewer id Electron uses) are kept.

